Subject: [PATCH 141/144] power: supply: qcom_battmgr: prepare bounded normal
 wireless charging

Consolidate raw limits, receiver query lifecycle, FOD shadows, bounded experiments and fresh flow/voltage telemetry.

Consolidated from local follow-ups:
  e924f823f5ba2eb6bf899b32fc13c10f270c5811 power: supply: qcom_battmgr: read raw normal charging limits
  bca178fd0eb9b7ad747cdb851e7ff8bc3705cb5e power: supply: nu1669: add an explicit bounded GET_TX_ID diagnostic
  22a45879d46414115d4288a76664fddbb8584479 power: supply: nu1669: cancel queries before debugfs removal
  0ca35466d2d9f00c664349f7b2aa74e40597a6f7 power: supply: nu1669: use the nonseekable default for query writes
  1b7c5a61880ff36a01fab59179fc8b7214cb47a1 power: supply: nu1669: expose passive raw FOD mailbox shadows
  b13306d29f8bf4da1115b4900fc123c0579ea546 power: supply: qcom_battmgr: bound an ACK-only input request experiment
  08aa82e9ebc592d956e4ae0488e541b7a6679b9a power: supply: qcom_battmgr: couple a bounded 750mA input experiment to manual pause
  ca45f232fb1bd168514554d1940eee1c42d4b4db power: supply: qcom_battmgr: report fresh normal wireless battery flow
  f1eb7396f495fccb9f787131207239d0939dda76 power: supply: qcom_battmgr: read optional raw voltage sample pair
